      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TYPHOON LAD (4) won again and recorded an impressive time after leading them home recording back to back wins at Maitland over 400m (22.40). Hard to knock his form from this box, unbeaten in two starts. In great recent form and expected to measure up again. HELLO CHEVY (1) is a sprinter who thrives over these shorter races. Finished fifth latest over 272m at The Gardens (16.05) in a Grade 4/5. Form here at the trip excellent including three wins. Must be included in calculations. MAJOR CONFLICT (2) was below best last time when sixth but three back was a Grade 5 winner in quick time at this track. Key player on best and worth another try. SOUL OF FIRE (8) is always hard to beat when drawn in this box.",
